        },
        "description": "__Height:__ 160 cm (5'3\")\n\nA beautiful and popular girl who everyone likes. After hearing [Yukari](https://anilist.co/character/121846)'s confession, Misaki also confess that she likes Yukari but is reluctant to enter a relationship with Yukari due to the government's arranged marriage policy. She became friends with [Ririna Sanada](https://anilist.co/character/121847) after discovering that Ririna is Yukari's marriage partner.",
