        },
        "description": "__Height:__ 152 cm (5'0\")\n\nThe marriage partner chosen by the government for [Yukari Nejima](https://anilist.co/character/121846/). Ririna is somewhat of a tsundere. She is mostly very blunt and speaks what's on her mind which earned her the nickname Snooty Sanada. She claims to have no special feelings for Yukari and acts as a love cupid for Yukari and [Misaki](https://anilist.co/character/121845). She is very interested in romantic stories and encounters.",
        "gender": "Female",
