          ]
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b121848-VGF8msIIWc10.jpg"
        },
        "description": "__Height:__ 171 cm (5'7\")\n\nClose friend of [Yukari Nejima](https://anilist.co/character/121846). Yuusuke first met Yukari when an angry guy confronted Yuusuke for \"stealing his girlfriend\". Yuusuke is portrayed as a cool and handsome young man. He is very popular with the girls and even had a few ex-girlfriends. \n\n~!It is hinted that he has a special relationship with [Misaki](https://anilist.co/character/121845) which caused Yukari to think that Yuusuke might also like her. However, Yuusuke is still shrouded in mystery and whether he likes Misaki or not is unclear.!~",
        "gender": "Male",
        "age": "15-16"
      },
