        },
        "description": "__Height:__ 169 cm (5'6\")\n\nA shy young man who has less spine than a scarecrow, yet kind and understanding. He first fell in love with [Misaki Takazaki](https://anilist.co/character/121845) after lending her half his eraser and seeing her smile. Yukari however, is forced to be engaged with [Sanada Ririna](https://anilist.co/character/121847) by the government marriage policy after confessing to [Misaki Takazaki](https://anilist.co/character/121845).",
